<title>UK: SBC sets BLOC warrants on future Novartis shares.</title>
<headline>SBC sets BLOC warrants on future Novartis shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 20 thousand BLOC warrants on the future Novartis shares which is a basket comprising Sandoz and Ciba-Geigy, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    *		     ISSUE PRICE  **1416.40 SFR</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   11.JUL.97	   PAYDATE	25.OCT.96</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  **1515.00 SFR</p>
<p> NOTES	     *THE LOWER STRIKE PRICE IS 0.0 SFR AND THE CAP</p>
<p>			LEVEL WILL BE SET AT-THE-MONEY BASED ON THE</p>
<p>			CLOSING PRICE OF THE BASKET AS OF 18.OCT.96</p>
<p>		    **INDICATIVE LEVELS</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
